# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, or configure the same
# variables in your hosting provider's dashboard (e.g. Vercel → Project →
# Settings → Environment Variables) for production.

# --- "Place order" / "Order via WhatsApp" buttons on /checkout ---
# When a customer taps "確認付款" or "以 WhatsApp 落單", the site opens
# WhatsApp with a pre-filled order message (order number, item names,
# prices, and total). Configure ONE of the two variables below so that
# chat opens directly with the shop's own WhatsApp account (@MofuHavenHK)
# — without either one set, the button falls back to a generic WhatsApp
# share dialog that makes the customer search for a contact themselves.

# Option A (preferred) — the short-link code from the @MofuHavenHK
# WhatsApp Business app (Business tools → Short link). Doesn't require
# exposing the shop's raw phone number, and stays valid if the number
# ever changes.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_LINK_CODE=ABCD1234

# Option B — the @MofuHavenHK WhatsApp number in full international
# format (no leading +). Formatting characters are stripped automatically
# if you include them by mistake.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=85212345678
